---
const services = [
  'Brand strategy + positioning',
  'Offer design + packaging',
  'Customer experience architecture',
  'Marketing systems + infrastructure',
  'Messaging development',
];
---

<section class="section bg-paper" id="position">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="path">
      <span class="num">01</span>
      <span class="label">POSITION</span>
      <span class="slash">/</span>
      <span>WHY YOUR MARKETING DOESN'T LAND</span>
    </div>

    <div class="section-h split" data-reveal>
      <h2 class="h2" data-zoom>It's not your <span class="swatch">channels</span>. It's your <span class="swatch warm">conviction</span>.</h2>
      <div class="head-side">
        <p class="lead">
          Most marketing fails because the thinking was broken at the start.
          Sharper ads on a fuzzy offer. A new logo on a vague positioning.
          Funnels built on a customer experience that doesn't deliver.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="lead position-lead" data-reveal>
      I start where most marketers don't. <em>With your founder conviction.</em>
      I end where most marketers can't. <em>At your entire customer experience.</em>
      The result is a business that's the obvious choice. Without renting
      attention every month.
    </p>

    <ul class="services" data-slide-stagger>
      {services.map((s, i) => (
        <li class="svc">
          <span class="svc-num mono">S{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
          <span class="svc-label">{s}</span>
          <span class="svc-arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-h h2 .swatch { font-style: italic; }
  .head-side .lead { max-width: 44ch; }

  .position-lead {
    margin: var(--s-12) 0 var(--s-16);
    max-width: 70ch;
  }
  .position-lead em { font-style: italic; font-weight: 600; color: var(--warm); }

  .services {
    list-style: none;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .svc {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr 60px;
    gap: var(--s-4);
    padding: var(--s-6) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
    align-items: center;
    font-family: var(--f-sans);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2vw, 30px);
    letter-spacing: -0.018em;
    transition: padding .2s var(--ease), background .2s var(--ease), color .2s var(--ease);
  }
  .svc:hover { background: var(--accent); color: var(--bone); padding-left: var(--s-4); }
  .svc:hover .svc-num { color: var(--bone); opacity: 0.85; }
  .svc:hover .svc-arr { transform: translateX(8px); color: var(--bone); }

  .svc-num {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--ink-mute);
    transition: color .15s var(--ease), opacity .15s var(--ease);
  }
  .svc-arr {
    text-align: right;
    color: var(--ink-mute);
    font-size: 24px;
    transition: transform .2s var(--ease), color .15s var(--ease);
  }
</style>
